[2J[2;1HNAME
    Get-ConsoleCapability

SYNOPSIS
    Shows what ConsoleMonster detected about the current terminal.

    Returns the terminal profile: kind, mode (Interactive, Stream, Plain), colour depth, glyph tier, size, VT support,
    console font and the reasons behind each decision. -Refresh detects again (after a resize or font change).


SYNTAX
    Get-ConsoleCapability [-Refresh <SwitchParameter>] [<CommonParameters>]


DESCRIPTION
    Shows what ConsoleMonster detected about the current terminal.

    Returns the terminal profile: kind, mode (Interactive, Stream, Plain), colour depth, glyph tier, size, VT support,
    console font and the reasons behind each decision. -Refresh detects again (after a resize or font change).
    [23;1HRELATED LINKS[25;1HREMARKS
    To see the examples, type: "get-help Get-ConsoleCapability -examples".
    For more information, type: "get-help Get-ConsoleCapability -detailed".
    For technical information, type: "get-help Get-ConsoleCapability -full".[31;1H
